<h3><u>Hussaina Hussaina</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>hussain hussain hussain hussain<br />
hussaina hussaina hussaina hussaina<br />
karbala karbala hussain hussain</p>

<p>ay mere aaqa ay maula<br />
aap ko na dekha na suna<br />
chauda sadi se dil hai fida<br />
ghar me bitcha kar farshe azaa<br />
labbaik kaha<br />
kya karun dil hai tujh pe fida hussain<br />
shaahe karbobala hussain<br />
mein diwaana tera hussain<br />
ya hussain ya hussaina</p>

<p>mehraabe dil me azaa ki qasam<br />
qibla e jaa hai tu shaahe umam<br />
kaaba e ishq hai tera haram<br />
us ke tawaaf me nikle hum<br />
ho itna karam<br />
aarzoo karbala hai meri hussain<br />
aankh me hai nami hussain<br />
chaahta hun yahi hussain<br />
ya hussain ya hussaina</p>

<p>kyun na rakhun is par mein jabeen<br />
kaise na chumun mein wo zameen<br />
jispe rahe hain aap makeen<br />
aap ke qadmon ke hain wahi<br />
par naksh haseen<br />
mein fida tere qadmon pe hun hussain<br />
mere dil ka sukun hussain<br />
tu hai mera junun hussain<br />
ya hussain ya hussaina</p>

<p>ishqe man jaane man<br />
roohe man qalbe man<br />
bewatan bekafan baadshaahe zaman<br />
mazloom</p>

<p>yaad mujhe hai wo manzar<br />
laasha zameen pe tha na zeen par<br />
khushk gale par tha khanjar<br />
khaa ke giri gash ek muztar<br />
teri khwahar<br />
aah sajde ka sajda hai karbala<br />
aah qible ka qibla hai karbala<br />
aah kaabe ka kaaba hai karbala<br />
karbala karbala karbala</p>

<p>karbala karbala karbala</p>

<p>jaa na saka gar karbobala<br />
dekha nahi jo roza tera<br />
khaaq wujud hai phir mera<br />
khaaq me tu us ko mila<br />
yane ke khaaqe karbobala<br />
gar jiyun to bhi tujh pe marun hussain<br />
aur ayse marun hussain<br />
jaise zinda rahun hussain<br />
ya hussain ya hussaina</p>

<p>zaade safar kuch kam hai magar<br />
dil pe huwa hai aysa asar<br />
ishq me tere shaam o sahar<br />
karbobala ki simt safar<br />
karti hai nazar<br />
mesum aur salman bayaan<br />
zikr karo ye misle azaan<br />
hoga ye jab bedaar jahaan<br />
aaenge mehdi shaahe zamaan<br />
aaj jo diwaanon ne kahaa<br />
saara jahaan kal dega sadaa</p>
</p>